From: Mike Kinney <mike.kinney@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 14 Nov 2026 14:48:48 -0800
Subject: [PATCH] fix(sim): require a distance band for rim vertex crossings

Keep near-trace neighbours under the wall check for segment and arc traces.

Co-Authored-By: Codex <noreply@openai.com>

Fixes #1669
